paraphrases:[P('buy from abroad','import goods','purchase from overseas suppliers','source products internationally','source强调采购过程。'),P('sell overseas','export','serve foreign markets','supply customers in other countries','serve a market是自然商业搭配。'),P('make trade easier','facilitate trade','reduce commercial friction','simplify cross-border exchange','commercial friction包括程序和成本障碍。'),P('protect local firms','support domestic producers','shield home industries','limit foreign competition faced by local businesses','shield通常暗示保护措施。'),P('depend on one country','rely on a single supplier nation','have concentrated trade dependence','source essential goods from one external market','concentrated突出风险集中。'),P('delivery delay','shipping disruption','an interruption to freight movement','a delay within an international supply chain','freight movement适合物流语境。'),P('trade rules','commercial regulations','cross-border trading requirements','rules governing international exchange','governing表示管理约束。'),P('lower prices','more affordable goods','reduced consumer prices','a decline in the retail cost of products','retail cost明确消费者端。')],
sentences:[S('Although importing + product + can lower + cost, relying on + narrow source + leaves + group + vulnerable to + disruption.','虽然进口某产品可以降低成本，但依赖单一来源会使某群体容易受到中断影响。','Although importing medical equipment can lower procurement costs, relying on one supplier leaves hospitals vulnerable to shipping disruption.'),S('The extent to which + policy + benefits + group + depends on whether + practical condition.','某项政策在多大程度上使某群体受益，取决于某个实际条件是否成立。','The extent to which a trade agreement benefits small exporters depends on whether customs procedures become easier to navigate.'),S('Rather than choosing between + option A + and + option B, governments can + balanced action.','政府不必在两个选项中二选一，而可以采取兼顾双方的措施。','Rather than choosing between open trade and complete self-sufficiency, governments can diversify suppliers for essential goods.')],
