paraphrases:[P('temporary job','short-term assignment','one-off paid task','a time-limited piece of work','gig通常比temporary job更短且按任务计酬。'),P('work when you want','choose working hours','exercise control over one’s schedule','decide when to make oneself available for work','available不保证一定获得任务。'),P('unstable pay','irregular earnings','income volatility','substantial variation in income over time','volatility适合分析经济风险。'),P('worker benefits','employment benefits','work-related social protection','entitlements such as leave and sick pay','entitlement指依法或依规享有的待遇。'),P('app company','digital labour platform','platform operator','a company that matches workers with customers online','platform operator较中性。'),P('work expenses','job-related costs','operating expenses borne by workers','costs incurred while providing a service','incurred是正式写作搭配。'),P('customer score','user rating','platform reputation score','a numerical evaluation submitted by a client','reputation score强调评分影响接单。'),P('secure job','stable employment','work with predictable income','employment offering continuity and protection','continuity突出持续性。')],
sentences:[S('The freedom to + flexible action + is valuable only if + worker + can also + practical need.','做某项灵活安排的自由只有在劳动者还能满足实际需要时才真正有价值。','The freedom to choose working hours is valuable only if a courier can also earn enough during those hours.'),S('Because + platform decision + determines + work outcome, workers need a clear way to + challenge action.','由于平台决定会影响工作结果，劳动者需要清晰的申诉途径。','Because an automated rating determines access to orders, workers need a clear way to challenge incorrect reviews.'),S('Instead of attaching + benefit + to one employer, a portable system could + action + whenever + worker activity.','与其把福利绑定在单一雇主上，可携带制度可以在劳动者每次工作时作出相应积累。','Instead of attaching leave to one employer, a portable system could collect contributions whenever a worker completes a job.')],
